RimDroid is an unofficial, community-developed compatibility launcher for running
the Linux x86_64 version of RimWorld on ARM64 Android devices.

Using RimDroid requires a complete Linux installation of RimWorld and any DLC the
user chooses to enable. RimWorld and its related names and trademarks belong to
Ludeon Studios Inc.

